MULTI-LLM CANDIDATE REGISTRY SCHEMA

Candidate set: A
Each candidate provides:
    name
    transform(state)
    preserves_curvature attestation
    preserves_topology_flow attestation
    observe(transformed_state)
    curvature_continuous(transformed_state)

Admission is evaluated by Ω_C(g). Only candidates with Ω_C(g) = 1 belong to
A_C*. This file defines a schema; it does not register or admit agents.
